![major](https://app.cortex.foundation/badges/security/major.svg) **Missing return type leads to implicit undefined**

Function getParseAs declares return type Exclude<Config['parseAs'], 'auto'>, but on line 78 returns without a value when cleanContent is empty after trimming. This returns undefined at runtime, which violates the type contract and will cause downstream code expecting a valid parseAs value to receive undefined.

```suggestion
  if (!cleanContent) {
    return 'stream';
  }
```

