![note](https://app.cortex.foundation/badges/security/note.svg) **Prefix check allows unexpected content types**

The check `cleanContent.startsWith('application/')` matches any content type starting with 'application/', including types like 'application/octet-stream' that are not JSON blobs, causing the function to return 'blob' instead of 'stream'. An external caller sending 'application/octet-stream' will have the response parsed as a blob rather than a raw stream, which may not match the caller's expectation.

```suggestion
if (
    ['application/json', 'application/octet-stream', 'audio/', 'image/', 'video/'].some((type) => cleanContent.startsWith(type))
  ) {
```

